WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.180
Most yacht websites are brochures,

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:08.160
a buyer looks, leaves and buys from the yard next door.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.400
Harbour Leads turns your website into a sales system.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:17.820
Every model gets its own page and every page asks for the enquiry.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:24.140
Buyers build their yacht in 3D and the build lands in your CRM as a hot lead.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:28.860
Charter guests book inside your website in an app with its own look.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:34.940
Every enquiry arrives in one place with a reply clock and the source it came from,

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.140
the page, the campaign,

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.540
the boat show.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.640
We don't promise we show you with your own yachts.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:43.860
Live in 2 weeks,

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.780
book a 15 minute demo.
